#====================================================================
# Draft knowledge entry - application packages must install to Conan
# standard bin/ (not upstream sbin/): CI L5 scans bin/lib only and L1e
# sabotage is silently skipped without standard artifact dirs
# Source: sysrqd/17 r2->r3 (2026-10-01)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-ci-l5-l1e-standard-bindir-sbin-packages
trigger_tool:           conan|build_and_test.sh
phase:                  packaging|ci-gate
error_signature:        L5: No bin/ or lib/ content found|L5_RESULT=warn: no artifacts found|L1e: No standard artifact dirs found to sabotage

severity:               2
category:               conan|packaging|ci|application
match_keywords:         sbin, bindirs, bin/, L5, warn, no artifacts, L1e, sabotage, destructive negative test, R34, application, /usr/sbin, daemon, sysrqd, NUT, upsd, kmod, package_type application

title:                  application 包产物须放 Conan 标准 bin/ 而非上游 sbin/：L5 只扫 bin/lib（warn 非 fail 易误判），L1e 破坏性验证会因无标准目录被静默跳过

root_cause:             >
    build_and_test.sh 的 L5（产物存在性）与 L1e（sabotage）只扫描 bin/ 与 lib/。
    上游安装到 /usr/sbin 的守护进程类包（sysrqd、NUT upsd、kmod 等）若照搬
    上游布局打包到 sbin/，CI 识别不到产物：L5 永远 warn（非 fail，易被当成
    过了），L1e 永远 skip——等于绕过「test_package 必须真依赖产物」的 R34
    门禁（对比 E560 判空壳逻辑：根本不给 sabotage 机会就没有 CI 级证明）。

rec_approach:           package-to-conan-standard-bindir
rec_description:        >
    package() 复制可执行文件到 bin/（配方注释说明上游原生 sbin 路径差异），
    package_info() 设 bindirs=["bin"]，test_package 兜底路径用 ../bin/<name>。
    连带影响：产物进 bin/ 后 L2 冒烟会执行 --version/--help，无参数解析的 CLI
    会 non-blocking skip/fail，按 E503 归因处理，不为 L2 伪造参数解析。
rec_command:            copy(self, "sysrqd", src=src, dst=os.path.join(self.package_folder, "bin")); os.chmod(os.path.join(self.package_folder, "bin", "sysrqd"), 0o755); self.cpp_info.bindirs = ["bin"]
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               conan-recipe

verification_cmd:       grep -n 'RESULT=' <stdout.log> | grep -E 'L5|L1e'   # 期望 L5_RESULT=pass: bin/ has content 且 L1e 为 Negative test confirmed
evidence:               |
    sysrqd/17 r2：产物 sbin/ → L5_RESULT=warn: no artifacts found、L1e skip
    (No standard artifact dirs found to sabotage)，总 exit 0。仅改产物目录为
    bin/ 后 r3：L5_RESULT=pass: bin/ has content、[sabotage] bin/ moved away →
    Negative test confirmed — test genuinely depends on sysrqd，总 exit 0。

similar_to:             E560(L1e空壳判定)|E503(L2冒烟vs无参数CLI)|DRAFT-E598-subpackage-test-package-consumer-proof
source_package:         sysrqd/17
status:                 UNMATCHED
